Sorry that I screw up the codes posted last time as in my code that is run, all cauchy are
cauchy(0, 5).

And in my simulated data, N = 30, mu = 0, sigma = 1.  This time, I directly copy and paste the code used,
hoping not to make any mistakes.

I added the transformation using normal CDF, which seems to make the model a lot worse (sometimes Stan
reports

> Error in sampler$call_sampler(args_list[[i]]) :
>   Posterior is improper. Please check your model.
> error occurred during calling the sampler; sampling not done
