> or frequent the non-fatal rejection errors.

This is the summary of ESS and running time for estimating model 1 and 2 for 200 times.  Basically, there is no
much difference between with/without the transformation on the cauchy prior for this particular model.
I think for this simple model n_eff/iter is not that different from n_eff/second.

> summary(s1)
       mu           sigma        user.self          sys.self        elapsed          user.child   sys.child
 Min.   :1429   Min.   :1294   Min.   :0.06600   Min.   :0e+00   Min.   :0.06600   Min.   :0    Min.   :0
